{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45076","headline":"冬日天井西峰张链师所居 · 皎然","name":"冬日天井西峰张链师所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采薪逢野泉，渐见栖闲所。\n坎坎山上声，幽幽林中语。\n仙乡何代隐，乡服言亦楚。\n开水净药苗，扫雪候山侣。\n零叶聚败篱，幽花积寒渚。\n冥冥孤鹤性，天外思轻举。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45076.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45076","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}